      hu: "Paoting történelmi város Hopej tartományban, amely egykor a tartomány székhelye volt. Peking közelében fekszik, itt található a Csili kormányzói hivatal, a Csing-dinasztia egyik legjobb állapotban fennmaradt közigazgatási központja. A város a hagyományos orvoslásról és a Paoting-golyókról is híres.",
      ro: "Baoding este un oraș istoric din provincia Hebei, fiind în trecut capitala provinciei. Situat aproape de Beijing, găzduiește Guvernământul Zhili, unul dintre cele mai bine conservate sedii administrative din dinastia Qing. Orașul este cunoscut și pentru medicina tradițională și bilele de relaxare Baoding.",
      en: "Baoding is a historic city in Hebei Province and was once the provincial capital. It is located near Beijing and houses the Zhili Governor's Office, one of the best-preserved Qing Dynasty government headquarters. The city is also famous for its traditional Chinese medicine and Baoding iron balls.",
